/**
 * @defgroup MutdGeo MutdGeo — Muon Telescope Detector Geometry
 * @ingroup StarVMCGeometry
 * @brief AGML geometry modules for the STAR Muon Telescope Detector (MTD/MUTD).
 *
 * The Muon Telescope Detector is a Multi-gap Resistive Plate Chamber (MRPC)
 * based detector mounted on the outside of the STAR solenoidal magnet at a
 * radius of approximately 364–430 cm.  It covers the central rapidity region
 * |η| < 0.5.  The detector is segmented into 30 azimuthal back-leg positions,
 * each carrying a group of 3 or 5 WMRPC trays.
 *
 * This directory contains six AGML modules (plus the configuration file)
 * that describe the evolution of the MTD geometry from Run 9/10 through
 * Run 16 and beyond:
 *
 *   - **MUTDGEO** (`MutdGeo.xml`) — Original CTB/TOF-era geometry: 30 sectors,
 *     each with two radial trays (aluminium boxes containing polystyrene
 *     scintillator slabs), a PMT housing, and an MRPC box.  Author: M. Potekhin,
 *     March 2006.
 *
 *   - **MUTDGEO2** (`MutdGeo2.xml`) — Simplified variant of v1: removes the
 *     tray internal structure; loops over 60 individual sector placements.
 *     Sensitive volume is the MRPC box (MMRP) only.
 *
 *   - **MUTDGEO3** (`MutdGeo3.xml`) — Single-sector variant that restores the
 *     full tray mechanical hierarchy of v1 but places one MUSC at φ = 210°
 *     with the MMRP and MTRA shifted to z = −128.81 cm.
 *
 *   - **MUTDGEO4** (`MutdGeo4.xml`) — Major redesign by W.J. Llope (July 2010)
 *     introducing the WMRPC tray model: aluminium top/bottom plates (MTBP,
 *     MTTP), U-channel structural members (MCHL/MCHS with air cores MCAL/
 *     MCAS), and a 5- or 6-gap inner glass stack (MIGS containing MIGG gas
 *     gaps).  Selects the partial or full MTD configuration via the integer
 *     `config` parameter (4 = Run 11 single back-leg, 5 = Run 12 partial,
 *     12 = Run 12 three back-legs, 13 = Run 13 outer back-legs only).
 *
 *   - **MUTDGEO5** (`MutdGeo5.xml`) — Extension by W.J. Llope (Dec 2013):
 *     unifies 3-tray and 5-tray group volumes into one parameterized `MTTG`
 *     volume; adds per-back-leg radii array `Ri(30)` from CADD engineering
 *     drawings; places MUTD in the `MagRefSys` reference group.  Adds config
 *     14 for the full 30 back-leg Run 14 system (cradle back-legs 12–20 get
 *     3-tray groups; the rest get 5-tray groups) with azimuthal Y-shifts for
 *     bus-cover back-legs 8 and 24.  Config 5 is marked obsolete.
 *
 *   - **MUTDGEO7** (`MutdGeo7.xml`) — Run 15+ revision (T. Todoroki,
 *     Nov 2015): adds a second radii table `RiRun15(30)` with re-measured CADD
 *     values; introduces a versioned second MTDD fill (version = 1.1) that
 *     corrects the sign convention for the bus-cover Y-shifts; selects the fill
 *     via `<Use select="version" value="MTDG_version">`.  Config ≥ 15 uses
 *     `RiRun15`.  Setup MUTD16 initialises version = 1.1 to activate the
 *     corrected Y-shifts.
 *
 * @par Setup configurations (MutdConfig.xml)
 * | Setup   | Module     | config | Run era      |
 * |---------|------------|:------:|--------------|
 * | MUTDof  | MutdGeo    | —      | off          |
 * | MUTD01  | MutdGeo    | —      | Run 9/10     |
 * | MUTD02  | MutdGeo2   | —      | —            |
 * | MUTD03  | MutdGeo3   | —      | —            |
 * | MUTD04  | MutdGeo4   | 4      | Run 11       |
 * | MUTD05  | MutdGeo4   | 5      | Run 12 early |
 * | MUTD12  | MutdGeo4   | 12     | Run 12       |
 * | MUTD13  | MutdGeo4   | 13     | Run 13       |
 * | MUTD14  | MutdGeo5   | 14     | Run 14       |
 * | MUTD15  | MutdGeo7   | 15     | Run 15       |
 * | MUTD16  | MutdGeo7   | 16     | Run 16+      |
 *
 * @par Key dimensions (WMRPC tray, MutdGeo4+)
 * - Tray half-height (radial): 2.496 cm
 * - Tray half-width: 33.765 cm
 * - Tray half-length: 54.005 cm
 * - Gas gap thickness: 0.25 mm (5 gaps per tray)
 * - Thin glass electrode: 0.7 mm
 *
 * @par Sensitive volumes
 * - `MXSA` — polystyrene scintillator slab (MutdGeo v1/v3)
 * - `MMRP` — RPCgas MRPC box (MutdGeo v1/v2/v3)
 * - `MIGG` — RPCgas single WMRPC gas gap (MutdGeo v4/v5/v7)
 *
 * @see StMtdHit, StMtdCollection
 * @{
 */

/**
 * @var MUTDGEO
 * @brief Original CTB/TOF-era scintillator + MRPC geometry (Run 9/10).
 * Module defined in MutdGeo.xml.
 */

/**
 * @var MUTDGEO2
 * @brief Simplified loop-over-sectors variant (no internal tray structure).
 * Module defined in MutdGeo2.xml.
 */

/**
 * @var MUTDGEO3
 * @brief Single-sector offset variant restoring tray mechanical structure.
 * Module defined in MutdGeo3.xml.
 */

/**
 * @var MUTDGEO4
 * @brief WMRPC tray model with config-driven partial/full system placement.
 * Module defined in MutdGeo4.xml.  Covers Run 11–13.
 */

/**
 * @var MUTDGEO5
 * @brief Full 30 back-leg system with per-back-leg CADD radii (Run 14).
 * Module defined in MutdGeo5.xml.
 */

/**
 * @var MUTDGEO7
 * @brief Run 15+ revision with corrected radii and Y-shift sign convention.
 * Module defined in MutdGeo7.xml.
 */

/**
 * @}
 */
